      "note": "PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex, Tibetan-first proposal. Four lexical las/karma occurrences are retained; the adjacent second las at the opening is an ablative particle and remains omitted. The three sems tokens own minds, mind after through, and mind after depends, respectively; final mind itself is supplied explanation. sems dang bcas pa is contentious: ILL:2686 reads those who possess a mind, while this row distributes it over mind and what comes along with it. Only sems/mind is retained; the accompaniment/possessor relation stays omitted rather than nulled or assigned to gsog pa. gsog pa owns collected. yod pa ma yin is a phrase-level negative existence predicate rendered cease to be; auxiliaries stay outside. byed pa po/maker and tshor ba po/master cross in English, with master supported by the binding HTG2016 glossary despite ILL's one who has feelings. Supplied great/of all things and Sutra of the are excluded. The single med pa cannot be assigned uniquely to the two English no tokens and remains omitted. The later negation/expository frame and brten nas remain distributed and omitted. No source correction is proposed."
